     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Hello, </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I\r\nwas wondering if I could get your opinion about some results from mediation analysis in lavaan that I’m having a hard time interpreting.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">How do I interpret the results? Given that:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">the indirect effect\r\n     alone is significant (evidence for full mediation)<u></u><u></u></span></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">the relationship\r\n     between X and Y is negative (though not significant)<u></u><u></u></span></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Georgia,serif\">the relationship between X and M  is positive (and significant)</span></li><li style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">the relationship\r\n     between M and Y  is positive (and\r\n     significant)<u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:0in\">X is a categorical\r\n     variable (Group A vs Group B; with Group A coded as 1 and Group B coded as\r\n     0)<br></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">M and Y are latent\r\n     variables<u></u><u></u></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:10pt\">Any\r\nhelp that you can provide me would be greatly appreciated!</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
